named “RGAA”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This utility helps to define wether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"See for example ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"reference"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/WCAG21Requirements":{"type":"topic","title":"WCAG21Requirements","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/wcag21requirements","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WCAG21Requirements","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WCAG21Requirements","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WCAG 2.1 AA and AAA requirements use ratio for textual and non textual components"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/WCAG21Requirements","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio/requirementsAAA":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21